	(text "OFS2.DCDCEN = 1. All VLO balls share MCU_SW.\nL101 feeds every VCL ball; never tie MCU_VCORE to 3.3 V.\nC113 returns to VSS_DCDC. VCC_DCDC is tied to VCC.\nHUM Rev.1.30, Table 69.2 / Fig.69.1, pp.4042-4044."
